"""GMM (GSConnect / KDE Connect Mount Manager) 2.0.1.

Automatically organizes and provides seamless access to Android device storage
via GSConnect and KDE Connect. Creates clean GTK bookmarks and local symlinks
for smooth file browsing with zero busy-polling.
"""

